WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.789
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:02.789 --> 00:00:04.580
MAYA KACZOROWSKI: Hi,
I'm Maya Kaczorowski.

00:00:04.580 --> 00:00:07.370
I'm a product manager in
container security at Google.

00:00:07.370 --> 00:00:09.500
And I'm here at KubeCon
EU in Copenhagen.

00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:12.470
And I'm so excited, and not only
because the food in Copenhagen

00:00:12.470 --> 00:00:14.480
is absolutely delicious,
but it's actually

00:00:14.480 --> 00:00:15.927
my second KubeCon.

00:00:15.927 --> 00:00:18.010
Today at KubeCon we made
a couple of announcements

00:00:18.010 --> 00:00:21.046
around partners, including five
partners that now integrate

00:00:21.046 --> 00:00:22.670
with the Cloud Security
Command Center,

00:00:22.670 --> 00:00:25.010
meaning you can see partner
results written directly

00:00:25.010 --> 00:00:27.290
as part of the Google
Cloud platform.

00:00:27.290 --> 00:00:28.460
We're going to go talk
to some of these partners

00:00:28.460 --> 00:00:29.918
and some other
Google partners now.

00:00:29.918 --> 00:00:31.640
So let's go.

00:00:31.640 --> 00:00:34.390
[MUSIC PLAYING]

